"P2847039519" "<shout>We're Slag Golems, and we're attacking!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4186247988" "'Big Rocky'"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P938051367" "I, Rocky!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3137066814" "Crush!"

